<p><%= mail_greeting %></p>
<p>Your EsignCenter account is getting close to the fair-use limit for document storage.</p>
<p>If it reaches that limit, uploads pause: nobody on the account can add new documents or a new logo until some room is freed. Sending and signing are never affected by storage: documents already uploaded can still be sent, and signers can still complete them.</p>
<p>To free space, delete templates and documents you no longer need, then delete them permanently from the archive. Every file the account keeps counts — uploaded documents, templates, signed copies and their previews, and your logo.</p>
<% if @paid %>
  <p>Storage grows with your team: every seat you add raises the limit. If your work needs more than that, reply to this email and we will talk it through.</p>
<% else %>
  <p>The paid plan stores more for every user: $<%= @price %> per user per month, with a <%= @trial_days %>-day free trial.</p>
<% end %>
<p><%= link_to 'See your usage', @usage_url %></p>
<p>Thanks,<br>EsignCenter</p>
